  "description": "Junior explorer. The 24+ is an introduction to trail riding, capable of handling the challenges of a day in the forest\n\nFeaturing a confidence inspiring 6061 T-6 aluminium frame and fork, super stable geometry, and 2.6\" plus sized tyres giving the bike ample suspension without the need for a heavy suspenbsion fork. The 24+ is the ideal package for any wannabe trail rider\n\nFitted with a Shimano Altus 7 Speed drivetrain with Rapidfire shifter and Tektro M276 hydraulic disc brakes, this bike has all the capabilities of tacking whatever the rider can throw at it. The 24+ also features an aluminium bar, stem and seatpost kit, helping to keep the overall weight of the bike as low as possible.\n\nThe Vee Crown Gem 20 x 2.6\" tyres are a fantastic way to experience trail riding for the first time. Weighing significantly less than suspension forks, and the ability to adjust the ride with pressure changes, they also add grip and stability to the bike making the riding experience more enjoyable.\n\nLightweight Aluminium frame and fork\n\nConfidence inspiring geometry\n\n7 Speed Shimano gearing\n\nDisc brakes\n\nVee Crown Gem 2.6\" plus size tyres\n\nAdjustable short-reach brake levers",
